# OpenClaw Workflows Summary

A collection of AI agent prompts and workflows adapted from velvet-shark's GitHub Gist.

## 1. Morning Briefing
**Goal:** Daily summary of interests from Twitter/X.
**Prompt:** Run at 7:00am. Scan last ~100 tweets. Pick top 10 relevant to AI, dev tools, etc. Write structured summary to Obsidian (`/Daily/YYYY-MM-DD-briefing.md`). Append video ideas to backlog. Send summary via chat.

## 2. Daily AI Art ("Moment Before")
**Goal:** Generate historical art for e-ink display.
**Prompt:** Run at 5:30am. Fetch "On This Day" from Wikipedia. Pick most dramatic event. Generate woodcut/linocut image of 10 seconds *before* the event (black and white, 800x480). Push to TRMNL display. Only include date/location text.

## 3. Maintenance & Backups
**Goal:** Automated system updates and secure backups.
**Update Prompt:** Run at 4:00am. Update OpenClaw, gateway, plugins. Restart gateway. Report to #monitoring.
**Backup Prompt:** Run at 4:30am. Push critical files to private GitHub repo. Scan for leaked secrets and replace with placeholders (e.g., `[CLAUDE_API_KEY]`). Commit with date/summary.

## 4. Background Health Checks
**Goal:** Periodic monitoring of crucial systems.
**Prompt:** Run every 30 mins (7am-11pm). Scan inbox for urgent items. Check calendar for next 2 hours. Check self-hosted services via Coolify. Rules: Only alert if attention needed. DRAFT-ONLY for emails.

## 5. Parallel Research Agent
**Goal:** Deep, multi-source topic research.
**Prompt:** Launch parallel sub-agents for [TOPIC] across: Twitter (last 2 weeks), Reddit, Hacker News, YouTube, Web/blogs. Synthesize into Obsidian (`/Research/YYYY-MM-DD-[topic-slug].md`).

## 6. YouTube Stats Analysis
**Goal:** Natural language querying of channel analytics.
**Prompt:** Access YouTube analytics. Answer questions like "How did my last 5 videos compare?" or "Which topics get engagement?". Provide data and interpretation.

## 8. Infrastructure & DevOps
**Goal:** Server monitoring and safe maintenance.
**Prompt:** Use SSH and Coolify API. Check resources. Before fixing, state intended actions (no destructive acts without approval). Create step-by-step migration plans and wait for approval.

## 9. Mobile Coding
**Goal:** Execute code changes via phone requests.
**Prompt:** SSH to dev server, navigate to repo. Make changes, create branch, commit with message. Push, create PR, and send PR link.

## 10. Email Triage (Draft-Only)
**Goal:** Safe email management.
**Prompt:** STRICT DRAFT-ONLY MODE. Classify emails (urgent, important, FYI, spam). Draft replies for urgent/important in user's tone. Save in Drafts. Notify in chat: "[Urgent] Email from [sender] - draft reply ready."

## 15. Discord Channel Routing (Model specific)
**Strategy:** Route tasks to specialized models based on channel:
- `#general`: Daily tasks (Sonnet)
- `#youtube-stats`: Analytics (Haiku)
- `#video-research`: Deep thinking (Opus)
- `#inbox`: Bookmark processing (Sonnet)
- `#monitoring`: Server health (Haiku)

## 16. Bookmark Management
**Goal:** Auto-process URLs dropped in chat.
**Prompt:** When URL dropped in #inbox: Fetch/read content. Write 2-3 sentence summary & key takeaways. Auto-tag. Save to Obsidian (`/Bookmarks/YYYY-MM-DD-[title-slug].md`).

## 17. Obsidian Semantic Search
**Goal:** Natural language search over notes.
**Prompt:** Build embedding index using QMD. Nightly cron job (3:00am) to update index. When asked questions, search index and return relevant notes/excerpts.

